WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:04.070
London Bridge is broken down,

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:07.440
broken down, broken down...

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.900
London Bridge is broken down,

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.230
my fair lady...

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:17.240
Farewell, Lupin...

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:18.750
forever.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:43.890
Warmth

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.350
And now, it begins.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:59.720
Look, Father.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.460
I've proven useful, haven't I?

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:05.910
So please, love me!

00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:07.910
Father!

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:17.050
Wh-What was that?

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:20.380
Cardia...

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:21.530
Let's hurry!

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:22.280
Right!

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:26.530
N-No...

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.650
<i>Now, come to me,</i>

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.140
<i>Cardia.</i>

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:49.650
<i>Cardia...</i>

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:55.980
<i>My beloved daughter...</i>

00:01:56.290 --> 00:01:58.600
Father...

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:17.930
Cardia.

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:21.360
Cardia. Wake up, now.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.700
Just a little longer...

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.470
Come on, Mom!

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:35.460
Can't we eat yet?

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:40.360
Finis, we can eat once everyone is 
here and we've said our prayer.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:41.960
Morning.

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:44.260
Well, look at you, sleepyhead.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:46.180
Sis, you're late!

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:49.180
It smells so good!

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:51.440
It's just bean soup again.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.350
That's fine! I like it!

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:55.490
What? I'm sick of it!

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:58.230
You'll never grow big 
if you talk like that!

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.630
<i>The food shortage in this village is grave.</i>

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:09.490
<i>The only thing that can save 
all who suffer is science...</i>

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.420
<i>The power of people themselves.</i>

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.000
How long must we wait?!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.870
Do something about this, now!

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:18.750
Yeah!

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:21.000
Research takes time.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:22.570
But I'm certain...

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:26.160
Just trust me, and with a bit more time...

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:27.650
It's too late.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.010
My son...

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.760
has already died of starvation!

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:34.270
He'll never return!

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.370
It's your fault!

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:40.150
Things went bad in this 
village after you showed up!

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:43.700
He's right! Scientists do 
the work of the devil!

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:44.130
Leave our village!

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:46.560
He has brought the wrath of God upon us!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.410
He caused this!

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:48.430
That's right!

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:49.330
Get out!

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.350
Get out of here, you jinx!

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.480
I don't...

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:10.270
I don't need a world like this!

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:13.430
Get out here, demon!

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:14.440
Yeah!

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:17.300
Get out here!

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:20.930
<i>Father was right.</i>

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.630
<i>I should just live in isolation here.</i>

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:27.880
<i>So long as I'm locked up in here,</i>

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:32.820
<i>I can't hurt anyone, or be hurt.</i>

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.490
<i>So I'll just...</i>

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:42.420
<i>I hear voices.</i>

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:46.600
<i>Why have they awakened me?</i>

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:50.740
<i>I wished to remain in my 
warm sleep forever...</i>

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.730
<i>All I wanted was to spend my life 
in warm, comfortable sleep.</i>

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:57.690
<i>It was because I couldn't 
bear to leave you alone.</i>

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:00.500
<i>I wanted to protect you.</i>

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.390
Cardia, what's your wish?

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:09.110
My wish?

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.080
I can't think of a wish.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:15.320
I've never even thought 
about what I'd wish for.

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:17.060
Is that right?

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:21.550
I know what your wish is, though.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.580
Just speak up.

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:28.860
I'm always prepared to take your hand.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:33.830
So tell me your wish... your dream!

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:37.280
Lupin...

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:42.220
Lupin, I... I...

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:44.100
I want to touch you!

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:46.860
Understood.

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:49.630
On my name, Arsène Lupin,

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:55.110
I swear to grant your wish!

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:56.300
Lupin!

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:03.380
Cardia!

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:11.510
Lupin, how...

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:15.520
I told you I'd steal you back, didn't I?

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:20.400
You're still alive?

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:27.230
Father...

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:40.990
You're still alive?

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:42.440
Father...

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:46.580
I'm a gentleman thief. 
Deceit is what I do best.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:49.010
That cut it a little close, though.

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:51.400
You managed to trick me.

00:06:51.980 --> 00:06:52.940
However...

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.010
Just what can you do?

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:59.380
You don't know, 
even after looking at Cardia?

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.000
I... The poison...

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:03.770
Yep.

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:08.260
The source of your poison, the Horologium,

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:09.780
has given most of its energy...

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.910
To Father?

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:22.250
I haven't analyzed the structure of 
the celestial globe in detail yet,

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:25.230
so I don't know how accurate 
my calculations are...

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:27.860
So it's all or nothing, then.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:30.250
Don't get the timing wrong.

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:35.050
If you leave just enough
 of the Horologium's energy

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:38.410
to keep Cardia alive and get her out,

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:42.780
it may be possible to 
completely nullify her poison.

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:48.310
It was a struggle to stop myself 
from just leaping right out.

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:50.400
I only had a brief moment, after all.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:54.960
I was warned that I couldn't afford to 
be a second too early or too late.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:57.310
Looks like I was right on the nose, though.

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:00.640
You planned it all for that purpose?

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.100
Well, do as you please.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:06.210
I've no more use for her, anyway.

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:10.310
Just like the failure lying over there.

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:14.500
How can you say that?

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:19.230
Finis cried out over and over 
that he wanted you to love him.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:20.920
He did it all...

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.350
He did it all for you!

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:25.590
Foolish.

00:08:26.010 --> 00:08:30.150
A disposable doll, demanding to be loved?

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:31.470
No!

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:38.620
Finis and I both lived our lives 
thinking, agonizing about things.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:41.210
We're not dolls!

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:48.070
I think you're far more of
 a monster than either of us!

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:52.890
I guess you're only an 
imitation, after all.

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:56.640
However, that no longer matters.

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:02.940
I have finally become a god!

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:06.910
Code: Realize has been achieved at last!

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:15.290
I can see everything.

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:20.900
Humans are fighting a war with 
the science I gave them.

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:25.910
They don't even realize they're 
dancing in the palm of my hand.

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:31.180
They will only fight, shed blood,
 and be controlled...

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:35.930
By me! This is inevitable!

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.680
I'm not so sure about that.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:42.070
Keep your eyes peeled and watch closely!

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:45.300
You don't want to miss this 
once-in-a-lifetime performance

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:48.490
by Arsène Lupin and his gang!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.200
What is all this?!

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:01.810
Some god you are, Isaac.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:05.190
You can't even see what's at your own feet.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:08.180
How dare you?!

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:10.950
Lupin!

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:25.560
Verify our situation!

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:28.480
Explosions are erupting
 throughout the ship!

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:35.200
So you're going to entertain me some more!

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:39.060
This is my lucky day!

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:40.500
Well, good for you!

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:47.620
It's been a most unlucky day for us.

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:52.960
I guess I really am lucky!

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:58.330
To think I'd get to see my best buddy
 and my lifelong rival again!

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:01.220
Well, that took the wind out of my sails.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.630
He's not such a bad guy, after all.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:08.000
But, you know, it was fate that 
brought us back together this way.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:12.190
Hey! What's the big idea?!

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:15.560
This is tyranny! I vehemently object!

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:18.850
Looks like this is it.

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:31.470
Lupin!

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:39.370
What did you do?!

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:44.400
The bombs we planted were no trick.

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:47.380
They were just simple products 
of gunpowder and fuses.

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:52.070
There's no way a monster of science 
like yourself could've detected them.

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:57.150
You got too wrapped up in your own power.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.900
We've won!

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.660
Why don't you understand?!

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:04.850
Someone has to guide those foolish humans,

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:06.910
or this world is bound for destruction!

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:10.410
It needs a being that surpasses 
human intelligence!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.150
True, maybe humans are fools.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:16.670
And they're weak and selfish.

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:18.170
But...

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:22.830
Some of them are struggling as 
hard as they can to change that.

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:28.180
There's no way you humans 
are capable of change!

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:35.190
There's no need to lose hope in 
humanity as much as you have.

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:38.480
Let's end this, Isaac.

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:42.260
The gentleman thief, Arsène Lupin,

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:45.990
will now take London back from your hands!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:05.680
Lupin!

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:10.940
Curse you...

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:12.690
Not...

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:15.470
Not here!

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:27.370
Father...

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.310
This massive thing's going to fall.

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:32.170
Let's get out of here.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:37.890
Father...

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:39.310
Finis!

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:40.270
Cardia!

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:47.320
Cardia...

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:51.630
It's not over yet!

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:53.160
It's not...

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:08.130
What are you doing?

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:12.320
I'll pull you up! Grab my arm, Finis!

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:13.990
What are you saying?

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:19.250
You won't get anything out of saving me!

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.850
You can't die!

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:27.100
Why? There's no place for me.

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:29.460
I have no reason to exist!

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:33.920
Because I'm a doll that's 
served its purpose!

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:37.250
No one will ever love me! I'm used garbage!

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:38.590
That's not true!

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:43.290
Don't... Don't say that.

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.390
I'll love you!

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:48.690
So live.

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:51.050
You're my little brother.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.900
You're the only family I have!

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:58.420
Let's live on together, Finis.

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:04.700
You really are a poor piece of work...

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:09.450
I refuse.

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:14.840
<i>Farewell, my sister.</i>

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:18.750
No! Finis!

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:20.140
Finis!

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:28.320
I can't lose you, too.

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:34.640
Van!

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:36.250
Where are Cardia and Lupin?

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:38.220
We haven't been able to contact them yet.

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:43.240
This shaking is big trouble!

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:45.200
It's going to fall at any moment!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:49.970
We have no choice. 
We need to leave for now.

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.470
What? But...

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:54.810
Let's trust him. It's our 
only choice right now.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.010
Damn it!

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:03.300
Watch out!

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:05.220
Lupin!

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:06.720
Go.

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:09.060
You have to run.

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:16.530
Looks like it's finally checkmate 
for the great Lupin.

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:22.360
What's wrong? Hurry and—

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:28.120
I'll stay with you.

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:31.870
Sheesh...

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:36.080
Sorry I couldn't keep my promise.

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:40.060
You said you wanted to 
feel another's warmth.

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:44.810
I was so confident in telling 
you I'd grant that wish.

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.620
I'm so pathetic.

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:48.080
That's not true.

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:51.650
I always felt warm beside you.

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:54.420
Cardia...

00:16:56.030 --> 00:17:00.120
Since this is the end anyway,
 let me grant it.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:02.880
Lupin!

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:04.410
I don't care.

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:06.890
I want to touch you.

00:17:07.850 --> 00:17:09.920
Just touching your heart isn't enough.

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:23.920
Lupin... I...

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:25.090
Cardia!

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:42.020
I'm... sorry...

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:43.940
Don't apologize.

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:47.800
Now I can finally make you mine alone.

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:51.330
I'm going to take all of you.

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:56.160
Yes. Even if the world ends, I love you.

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:58.580
I love you, too.

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:27.500
Take this to...

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:29.990
Just one second!

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:32.240
What?

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:37.570
I'm sure I'm wrong, Van, but you 
didn't make those, did you?

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.630
What if I did?

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:44.400
How could you do that?!
 This is gonna be our last supper!

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:48.270
Then let me give you an 
hors d'oeuvre before the meal.

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:52.570
H-Hey, even I can't cook with bullets...

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.670
Those are pretty.

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:57.650
Are they for her?

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.140
Yes.

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:04.150
Whoa, hang on! Where's Saint, anyway?

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:07.910
Hey, you're right. He was 
just here a moment ago...

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.270
That's typical of him.

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:19.170
If you were coming anyway, 
I wish you had dressed up.

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:23.670
I have orders to finalize things.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:30.680
I'm quite sure I discussed that matter with you
 when I proposed our cooperation.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:36.010
That sounds just like her.

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:39.410
I'm sure Idea's preferred ending

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:44.190
would have been for her to 
share the Nautilus's fate.

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:49.950
However, our little group 
does not like to give up.

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:09.600
This is senseless.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:16.320
I have no time to play 
along with your whims.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:20.820
Are you sure?

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.720
Do not let her out of your sight.

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.250
For as long as you live.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:27.960
There won't be a next time.

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:37.840
Cardia.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:39.870
Lupin!

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:41.560
You haven't changed yet?

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:43.690
Neither have you.

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:45.800
Are you nervous?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:46.890
A little.

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:50.020
And... I feel a bit uneasy.

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:51.020
Uneasy?

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:53.850
Yes. I'm just too happy.

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:58.850
I wonder...

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:02.220
how I'm still alive.

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:08.990
I'm certain the Horologium's 
energy ran out back then.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:11.630
But I'm alive.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:15.720
I'm a normal person, with no poison.

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:22.340
Was it Finis who gave me this life?

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:25.120
Or was it my father?

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:29.460
Maybe it was your strong will to live.

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:31.010
Or...

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:36.720
The power of your love for me, perhaps?

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:50.060
Count!

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:51.460
Forgive the delay.

00:21:52.670 --> 00:21:53.650
Here they come!

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:09.780
Congratulations, you two.

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:12.420
Congratulations.

00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:15.920
You look beautiful, Cardia!

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:17.930
You're an angel! No, a goddess!

00:22:17.930 --> 00:22:20.860
Damn it! All the good 
stuff happens to Lupin!

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.930
Can't I at least have a hug
 for my heartbreak?!

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:27.000
Uncle! Uncle!

00:22:28.950 --> 00:22:31.110
Hey! Wait, you two!

00:22:31.110 --> 00:22:32.880
This isn't the place for that!

00:22:31.710 --> 00:22:33.360
How very lively.

00:22:33.840 --> 00:22:37.270
They won't even have a chance 
to exchange vows at this rate.

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:39.700
Shall we postpone, then?

00:22:39.700 --> 00:22:40.910
Huh?

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:43.710
Ah, forget it.

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:52.550
I swear to you that whatever may come,
 I'll stay by your side,

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:56.180
and I'll continue to steal your heart 
for the rest of my life.

00:22:57.080 --> 00:23:00.900
I'll stay by your side, as well.

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:03.810
As long as I live.

00:23:04.890 --> 00:23:07.130
I love you, Cardia.

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:09.480
I love you, Lupin.

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:22.030
<i>Yes, this is where we begin...</i>

00:23:22.370 --> 00:23:24.000
<i>...to create...</i>

00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:27.530
<i>...our own new world.</i>
